@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.rdfs.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix outdoor: <http://outdoor-sports.org/ontology#> .

<http://outdoor-sports.org/ontology#> a owl:Ontology .

outdoor:Athlete a owl:Class .
outdoor:Gear a owl:Class .
outdoor:ClimbingSite a owl:Class .

outdoor:utilizesGear a owl:ObjectProperty .
outdoor:isUsedBy a owl:ObjectProperty .

outdoor:FontainebleauForest a owl:NamedIndividual , outdoor:ClimbingSite .
outdoor:YosemiteValley a owl:NamedIndividual , outdoor:ClimbingSite .